                "role": "Local Guide",
                "rating": 5
              },
              {
                "quote": "Moe, one of the Volvo techs, helps me by getting me in and out and makes the process easier for me. Great guy and knowledgeable.",
                "name": "Duby Bello",
                "role": "Service customer",
                "rating": 5
              },
              {
                "quote": "I come into Hudson for parts and service on my trucks frequently and I can’t see myself going anywhere else for my work. 5-star facility.",
                "name": "Samer Hablawi",
                "role": "Fleet owner",
                "rating": 5
              }
            ]
          }
        }
